@startuml demo-payment-redirect
title Demo payment redirect and return (kommunikacio.md 8.3)
actor Shopper
participant "Storefront\n/" as SF
participant "Demo payment\n/demo-fizetes/" as PAY
participant "Commerce API\n/api/v1" as API

SF -> API : POST /payment-intents (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
API --> SF : 201 PaymentIntent (requires_action, redirectUrl, returnUrl)
SF -> PAY : full page load of redirectUrl, the storefront SPA is discarded
PAY -> API : GET /payment-intents/{paymentIntentId}
API --> PAY : 200 PaymentIntent (amount)
Shopper -> PAY : choose succeeded, declined or pending
PAY -> API : POST /payment-intents/{paymentIntentId}/outcome (PaymentOutcomeRequest)
alt the intent still requires action
  API --> PAY : 200 PaymentIntent (the chosen status)
else the intent is already terminal
  API --> PAY : 409 Problem PAYMENT_ALREADY_RESOLVED
end
PAY -> SF : full page load of returnUrl, the storefront starts from zero
SF -> API : GET /payment-intents/{paymentIntentId}
API --> SF : 200 PaymentIntent (status)
@enduml
